        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "上一段讲到「GoogLeNet / Inception」。现在把镜头转向「ResNet」，沿着这条故事线换一个问题：研究者为什么需要「ResNet」？当时已有的方法究竟卡在了哪里？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "storyline-sequence"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "ResNet 引入残差连接，使很深的网络可以学习增量修正，而不是完整变换。它让数百层网络变得可训练，并成为视觉系统的常用骨干网络。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-deep-residual-learning-for-image-recognition"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "捷径路径把输入加回学习得到的残差变换。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-deep-residual-learning-for-image-recognition"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 ResNet 视为超深网络设计的转折点。它的长期影响在于残差学习：捷径连接让深度更容易优化，并成为视觉及其他领域的标准骨干思想。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-deep-residual-learning-for-image-recognition"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "这条线索还没有结束。接下来来到「DenseNet」，我们会看到研究者怎样把问题继续向前推进。",
